{"beeftv":{"client":"./client/index.js","configuration":{"fields":[{"description":"muse2api 的 MUSE2API_KEY。若中继启动时未配置，它会自动生成一个并写进 .env、打印在启动日志里，从那里复制过来。留空则中继侧可能拒绝鉴权（取决于中继是否配置了 Key）。","label":"Muse 中继 API Key","name":"apiKey","required":true,"type":"secret"},{"default":"http://127.0.0.1:18610","description":"muse2api 地址，默认 http://127.0.0.1:18610。注意：不要在末尾加 /v1，/v1/videos 路径由插件自带；画布与中继必须在同一台机器上（结果地址是中继的本地地址）。","label":"Base URL","name":"baseUrl","required":false,"type":"string"}]},"contributes":{"providers":[{"auth":{"field":"apiKey","type":"bearer"},"baseUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:18610","capabilities":["video"],"create":{"body":{"aspect_ratio":{"$omitEmpty":{"$ref":"request.aspectRatio"}},"duration":{"$if":{"condition":{"$gt":[{"$ref":"request.duration"},0]},"else":null,"then":{"$ref":"request.duration"}}},"images":{"$omitEmpty":{"$map":{"as":"media","from":{"$sortByOrder":{"$ref":"request.images"}},"in":{"$ref":"media.value"}}}},"model":{"$ref":"request.model"},"prompt":{"$ref":"request.prompt"},"resolution":{"$omitEmpty":{"$ref":"request.resolution"}}},"contentType":"application/json","method":"POST","originPath":true,"path":"/v1/videos"},"id":"muse-video","label":"Muse 视频（muse2api 中继）","mediaTransport":{"audio":"url","image":"inline","video":"url"},"parameters":[{"description":"Muse 视频模型 ID（muse-video）。","mapping":"model","name":"model","required":true,"type":"string"},{"description":"视频提示词。","mapping":"prompt","name":"prompt","required":true,"type":"string"},{"description":"参考图（首帧）。中继接受 data URL；URL 形式只接受公网地址（中继默认禁拉私网/localhost 地址，见 docs/interface.md）。","mapping":"images","name":"images","required":false,"type":"media[]"},{"description":"输出画幅比例（如 16:9、9:16）。中继只把它拼进提示词，不作结构化参数。","mapping":"aspect_ratio","name":"aspectRatio","required":false,"type":"string"},{"description":"画质规格（如 720P）。中继只把它拼进提示词（“画质规格：…”），上游是否采纳未验证。","mapping":"resolution","name":"resolution","required":false,"type":"string"},{"description":"视频输出时长秒数（整数）。中继只接受 duration；为 0 时不发，中继默认按 6 秒写进提示词。","mapping":"duration","name":"duration","required":false,"type":"integer"}],"poll":{"method":"GET","originPath":true,"path":"/v1/videos/{{taskId}}"},"requiresPublicMediaUrls":false,"response":{"errorPaths":["error","error.message"],"message":{"$coalesce":[{"$ref":"response.error.message"},{"$ref":"response.error"},{"$ref":"response.message"},{"$ref":"response.data.error.message"},{"$ref":"response.data.error"},{"$ref":"response.data.message"}]},"resultEphemeral":true,"status":{"$ref":"response.status"},"taskId":{"$coalesce":[{"$ref":"response.task_id"},{"$ref":"response.id"},{"$ref":"taskId"}]},"videos":{"$coalesce":[{"$ref":"response.url"},{"$ref":"response.video.url"},{"$ref":"response.result.url"},{"$ref":"response.data.url"},{"$ref":"response.data.video.url"},{"$ref":"response.data.result.url"},{"$ref":"response.data.videos"},{"$ref":"response.videos"}]}},"scopes":["admin.system-channel","user.custom-channel","canvas","creation","agent"]}]},"name":"Muse","permissions":["generation.run","media.read","ui.slot","settings.write"]},"description":"把 Muse（经 czg86389-hub/muse2api 中继）接进画布的视频协议插件。只声明视频 provider muse-video；文本 muse-spark 走宿主通用 chat-completion、图片 muse-image 走宿主通用 openai-image，均无需插件。视频提交为 JSON（不用内置 newapi 的 multipart），duration 为整数、不用 seconds。","keywords":["beeftv-plugin","muse","muse2api","video"],"license":"Apache-2.0","main":"./client/index.js","name":"beeftv-plugin-muse","type":"module","version":"1.0.0"}